cff-version: 1.2.0
abstract: >-
  PLAAC (Prion-Like Amino Acid Composition) is a web and command-line
  application for identifying proteins with prion-like amino acid composition.
  PLAAC searches protein sequences for candidate prion-like domains using a
  hidden-Markov model (HMM) algorithm and provides scores and visualizations
  for the resulting predictions.
